  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "嗯，姑娘怎么了？领导让我来后备箱拿茅台，可里面明明是空的，我不知道该怎么交差，回去肯定要被开除了。傻孩子，领导能不知道自己车里没酒吗？人家要的是结果，你看看这个视频，学学人家怎么做的。小李，你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，领导的暗示，你能听得懂吗？没有啊，哎被偷你干什么？赵总，茅台都被偷了，你为什么不让我说呀？领导能不知道后备箱有没有酒吗？不是，这职场上理会错，领导的意思是大忌。车里没有酒，赵总却让你送上去，说明他只在意结果，你又何必去在意。车里酒的去向和真实性呢满足领导的需求最重要。哦，赵总，您车里的东西呢，我不好乱翻，就自己准备了。四瓶两瓶，留在您车里了，这两瓶拿上来您先用公赵总，咱们下次见啊。哎哎好，哎，刘总你怎么走了呀？是不是嫌报价不满意啊？哼哎哎，恭喜赵总，拿下合同，小李，后续你来负责吧。哎，赵总这哎，这赵总，这怎么回事啊？这个项目一直是大刘在负责，赵总突然把项目给我了。茶汤。回鹘是谈判的收尾动作，象征着交易达成。大刘连这个都不懂，赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？不能吧，人情世故，可是门大学问，你要学的呀，还多着呢。老婆。赵总把上次的酒钱转过来了，你看哎，你怎么收了呀？赵总转多了，你赶紧给他退回去，你自以为有原则的退回，只会让领导觉得麻烦，还不如大大方方收下呢。那我是不是得说点啥呀？你就说感谢领导，大气，果然跟着领导有甜头吃，就这样就行了。当然不行啊，赵总，请大家喝奶茶了啊，人人都有。小李，你来一下。我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？奶茶钱，您不是跟着酒钱一块转给我了吗？小李周天来家里坐坐，尝尝你嫂子的手艺啊。哎嫂子，你可算出来了，我都快憋死了。哎哎，你拉我干什么？我也很急啊，憋死了，不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。哎呀，行了，你们做我去做饭，老赵帮我处理一下。鱼老婆，我怎么看？赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，因为异性厕所十分钟效应，人家赵总老婆刚从卫生间出来，你就是再着急，你等十分钟再走，怎么可能是因为这个你照做就行。嫂子，我来帮你三宝，赵总，嫂子，那我走了，那我们也先走小李，留下接待王总的事情，咱们再碰一下，那得叫小张回来啊，不用你来负责就行。好的，赵总，哎，老婆，你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，这都是不成文的社交规矩。你呀多看看这本把话说的恰到好处。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你就每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你也会变成一个会说话的人。当我听到这句话的时候，我的眼泪就出来了。他写的是别人夸你优秀，你就回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友？你看很有味道，假如不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。哇，这真是太棒了。在这本书里边，有句话我特别欣赏。他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，高情商回答，万物皆有裂痕，那是光照进来的地方。哇，这真是太棒了，每一句都很有意思，随便翻对吧？哇，这句话太棒了，他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，你就回比以前好多了。现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。我读到这段的时候，我觉得这个让我真是异解心开啊，这本书就像是个社交宝典，把各种社交场景都变成了问题。加答案的形式。你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。我觉得这书适合所有人，让你不管，在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏，所以强烈推荐。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 1820,
      "end_ms": 2060,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4980,
      "end_ms": 6960,
      "text": "姑娘怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7180,
      "end_ms": 8940,
      "text": "领导让我来后备箱拿茅台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9240,
      "end_ms": 10680,
      "text": "可里面明明是空的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11040,
      "end_ms": 12340,
      "text": "我不知道该怎么交差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12720,
      "end_ms": 14320,
      "text": "回去肯定要被开除了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14500,
      "end_ms": 15400,
      "text": "傻孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15680,
      "end_ms": 17780,
      "text": "领导能不知道自己车里没酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17920,
      "end_ms": 19280,
      "text": "人家要的是结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19660,
      "end_ms": 20780,
      "text": "你看看这个视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20960,
      "end_ms": 22380,
      "text": "学学人家怎么做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22380,
      "end_ms": 22800,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23100,
      "end_ms": 25135,
      "text": "你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30460,
      "end_ms": 31320,
      "text": "领导的暗示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 31320,
      "end_ms": 32320,
      "text": "你能听得懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33580,
      "end_ms": 34280,
      "text": "没有啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35800,
      "end_ms": 39430,
      "text": "哎被偷你干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39990,
      "end_ms": 40390,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40390,
      "end_ms": 41210,
      "text": "茅台都被偷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41210,
      "end_ms": 42410,
      "text": "你为什么不让我说呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 42430,
      "end_ms": 44310,
      "text": "领导能不知道后备箱有没有酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 44610,
      "end_ms": 44910,
      "text": "不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 44910,
      "end_ms": 47110,
      "text": "这职场上理会错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47110,
      "end_ms": 48450,
      "text": "领导的意思是大忌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 48930,
      "end_ms": 49750,
      "text": "车里没有酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 49990,
      "end_ms": 51430,
      "text": "赵总却让你送上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 51670,
      "end_ms": 53110,
      "text": "说明他只在意结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 53450,
      "end_ms": 54490,
      "text": "你又何必去在意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54490,
      "end_ms": 58490,
      "text": "车里酒的去向和真实性呢满足领导的需求最重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 58950,
      "end_ms": 59495,
      "text": "哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 61690,
      "end_ms": 62145,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 62630,
      "end_ms": 63590,
      "text": "您车里的东西呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63590,
      "end_ms": 64350,
      "text": "我不好乱翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64510,
      "end_ms": 65210,
      "text": "就自己准备了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 65210,
      "end_ms": 66260,
      "text": "四瓶两瓶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 66260,
      "end_ms": 67120,
      "text": "留在您车里了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 67260,
      "end_ms": 75460,
      "text": "这两瓶拿上来您先用公赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 75540,
      "end_ms": 76500,
      "text": "咱们下次见啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 76540,
      "end_ms": 77465,
      "text": "哎哎好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 77850,
      "end_ms": 78030,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 78030,
      "end_ms": 79190,
      "text": "刘总你怎么走了呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79430,
      "end_ms": 80765,
      "text": "是不是嫌报价不满意啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 81670,
      "end_ms": 83885,
      "text": "哼哎哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 87840,
      "end_ms": 88440,
      "text": "恭喜赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 88440,
      "end_ms": 89245,
      "text": "拿下合同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 90540,
      "end_ms": 91065,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 91380,
      "end_ms": 92765,
      "text": "后续你来负责吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 94680,
      "end_ms": 94920,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 94960,
      "end_ms": 97695,
      "text": "赵总这哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 97990,
      "end_ms": 98330,
      "text": "这赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 98330,
      "end_ms": 99275,
      "text": "这怎么回事啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 99710,
      "end_ms": 101275,
      "text": "这个项目一直是大刘在负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 101620,
      "end_ms": 103005,
      "text": "赵总突然把项目给我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 103230,
      "end_ms": 103590,
      "text": "茶汤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 103590,
      "end_ms": 105485,
      "text": "回鹘是谈判的收尾动作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 105790,
      "end_ms": 106890,
      "text": "象征着交易达成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 107090,
      "end_ms": 108290,
      "text": "大刘连这个都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 108510,
      "end_ms": 110335,
      "text": "赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 111130,
      "end_ms": 111710,
      "text": "不能吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 112170,
      "end_ms": 112950,
      "text": "人情世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 112950,
      "end_ms": 114045,
      "text": "可是门大学问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 114350,
      "end_ms": 115270,
      "text": "你要学的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 115270,
      "end_ms": 116095,
      "text": "还多着呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 116960,
      "end_ms": 117435,
      "text": "老婆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 118050,
      "end_ms": 119590,
      "text": "赵总把上次的酒钱转过来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 119590,
      "end_ms": 122290,
      "text": "你看哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 122390,
      "end_ms": 123330,
      "text": "你怎么收了呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 123410,
      "end_ms": 124210,
      "text": "赵总转多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 124210,
      "end_ms": 125205,
      "text": "你赶紧给他退回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 125390,
      "end_ms": 126910,
      "text": "你自以为有原则的退回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 126930,
      "end_ms": 128485,
      "text": "只会让领导觉得麻烦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 128860,
      "end_ms": 130205,
      "text": "还不如大大方方收下呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 131620,
      "end_ms": 133255,
      "text": "那我是不是得说点啥呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 133510,
      "end_ms": 134950,
      "text": "你就说感谢领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 134950,
      "end_ms": 135405,
      "text": "大气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 135850,
      "end_ms": 137505,
      "text": "果然跟着领导有甜头吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 138390,
      "end_ms": 139285,
      "text": "就这样就行了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 139730,
      "end_ms": 140685,
      "text": "当然不行啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 141620,
      "end_ms": 141960,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 141960,
      "end_ms": 143100,
      "text": "请大家喝奶茶了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 143140,
      "end_ms": 143885,
      "text": "人人都有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 148450,
      "end_ms": 148770,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 148770,
      "end_ms": 149275,
      "text": "你来一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 150770,
      "end_ms": 152575,
      "text": "我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 153210,
      "end_ms": 153810,
      "text": "奶茶钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 153810,
      "end_ms": 155655,
      "text": "您不是跟着酒钱一块转给我了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 156610,
      "end_ms": 158825,
      "text": "小李周天来家里坐坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 159300,
      "end_ms": 162975,
      "text": "尝尝你嫂子的手艺啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 163280,
      "end_ms": 163840,
      "text": "哎嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 163840,
      "end_ms": 164820,
      "text": "你可算出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 164860,
      "end_ms": 165995,
      "text": "我都快憋死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 168630,
      "end_ms": 169030,
      "text": "哎哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 170130,
      "end_ms": 171050,
      "text": "你拉我干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 171050,
      "end_ms": 171990,
      "text": "我也很急啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 172210,
      "end_ms": 173045,
      "text": "憋死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 174500,
      "end_ms": 178145,
      "text": "不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 178430,
      "end_ms": 178810,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 178870,
      "end_ms": 179425,
      "text": "行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 179720,
      "end_ms": 180760,
      "text": "你们做我去做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 180900,
      "end_ms": 181920,
      "text": "老赵帮我处理一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 181920,
      "end_ms": 183855,
      "text": "鱼老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 184400,
      "end_ms": 184980,
      "text": "我怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 185660,
      "end_ms": 187175,
      "text": "赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 187480,
      "end_ms": 189285,
      "text": "因为异性厕所十分钟效应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 189590,
      "end_ms": 191890,
      "text": "人家赵总老婆刚从卫生间出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 192010,
      "end_ms": 193070,
      "text": "你就是再着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 193130,
      "end_ms": 194070,
      "text": "你等十分钟再走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 194070,
      "end_ms": 196525,
      "text": "怎么可能是因为这个你照做就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 198310,
      "end_ms": 198630,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 198630,
      "end_ms": 200975,
      "text": "我来帮你三宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 202100,
      "end_ms": 202540,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 202600,
      "end_ms": 203060,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 203160,
      "end_ms": 203915,
      "text": "那我走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 205960,
      "end_ms": 209460,
      "text": "那我们也先走小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 209460,
      "end_ms": 211140,
      "text": "留下接待王总的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 211160,
      "end_ms": 211985,
      "text": "咱们再碰一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 212230,
      "end_ms": 213325,
      "text": "那得叫小张回来啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 213900,
      "end_ms": 215435,
      "text": "不用你来负责就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 216540,
      "end_ms": 216820,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 216820,
      "end_ms": 217215,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 217460,
      "end_ms": 217640,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 217640,
      "end_ms": 218145,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 218590,
      "end_ms": 221085,
      "text": "你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 221460,
      "end_ms": 223205,
      "text": "这都是不成文的社交规矩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 223560,
      "end_ms": 226245,
      "text": "你呀多看看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 226550,
      "end_ms": 227490,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 227550,
      "end_ms": 228190,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 228190,
      "end_ms": 228910,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 228990,
      "end_ms": 229970,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 230170,
      "end_ms": 231270,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 231350,
      "end_ms": 232615,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 232840,
      "end_ms": 234420,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 234420,
      "end_ms": 235640,
      "text": "当我听到这句话的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 235640,
      "end_ms": 236845,
      "text": "我的眼泪就出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 237070,
      "end_ms": 238530,
      "text": "他写的是别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 238530,
      "end_ms": 238970,
      "text": "你就回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 239150,
      "end_ms": 240110,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 240110,
      "end_ms": 241330,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 241530,
      "end_ms": 242470,
      "text": "你看很有味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 242490,
      "end_ms": 243470,
      "text": "假如不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 243550,
      "end_ms": 244210,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 244210,
      "end_ms": 244969,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 245110,
      "end_ms": 246150,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 246330,
      "end_ms": 247530,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 247690,
      "end_ms": 248935,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 249220,
      "end_ms": 251560,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 251560,
      "end_ms": 251740,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00148",
      "start_ms": 251740,
      "end_ms": 252705,
      "text": "这真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00149",
      "start_ms": 253000,
      "end_ms": 253720,
      "text": "在这本书里边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00150",
      "start_ms": 253720,
      "end_ms": 254945,
      "text": "有句话我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00151",
      "start_ms": 255260,
      "end_ms": 256680,
      "text": "他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00152",
      "start_ms": 256820,
      "end_ms": 257700,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00153",
      "start_ms": 257860,
      "end_ms": 258880,
      "text": "万物皆有裂痕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00154",
      "start_ms": 258960,
      "end_ms": 260175,
      "text": "那是光照进来的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00155",
      "start_ms": 260460,
      "end_ms": 260660,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00156",
      "start_ms": 260660,
      "end_ms": 261620,
      "text": "这真是太棒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00157",
      "start_ms": 261620,
      "end_ms": 262720,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00158",
      "start_ms": 262720,
      "end_ms": 263655,
      "text": "随便翻对吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00159",
      "start_ms": 264060,
      "end_ms": 264260,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00160",
      "start_ms": 264260,
      "end_ms": 265340,
      "text": "这句话太棒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00161",
      "start_ms": 265360,
      "end_ms": 267760,
      "text": "他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00162",
      "start_ms": 267780,
      "end_ms": 269385,
      "text": "你就回比以前好多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00163",
      "start_ms": 269730,
      "end_ms": 271605,
      "text": "现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00164",
      "start_ms": 271840,
      "end_ms": 272700,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00165",
      "start_ms": 272700,
      "end_ms": 274785,
      "text": "我觉得这个让我真是异解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00166",
      "start_ms": 275020,
      "end_ms": 276660,
      "text": "这本书就像是个社交宝典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00167",
      "start_ms": 276800,
      "end_ms": 278800,
      "text": "把各种社交场景都变成了问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00168",
      "start_ms": 278800,
      "end_ms": 279680,
      "text": "加答案的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00169",
      "start_ms": 279740,
      "end_ms": 282265,
      "text": "你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00170",
      "start_ms": 282510,
      "end_ms": 285495,
      "text": "就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00171",
      "start_ms": 285890,
      "end_ms": 288535,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00172",
      "start_ms": 288730,
      "end_ms": 289710,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00173",
      "start_ms": 289790,
      "end_ms": 291165,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00174",
      "start_ms": 291690,
      "end_ms": 293950,
      "text": "这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00175",
      "start_ms": 294050,
      "end_ms": 295495,
      "text": "我觉得这书适合所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00176",
      "start_ms": 295800,
      "end_ms": 296340,
      "text": "让你不管，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00177",
      "start_ms": 296340,
      "end_ms": 298515,
      "text": "在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2d64be04a47c5b4_s00178",
      "start_ms": 298840,
      "end_ms": 299735,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐。"
    }
  ],
  "previous_context": [],
